-- Sendzz on Stellar: USDC volume and transaction count by type.
--
-- --- Why the filter is not just the gas station ------------------------------
--
-- The obvious filter, fee_account = <our gas station>, is CAUSAL and needs no address list: we
-- paid the fee, so the transaction is ours. But it is only half the picture, and the half it
-- misses is the money coming IN.
--
-- When someone sends USDC into a Sendzz Stellar wallet, THEY submit and pay for that
-- transaction. Our gas station never appears. Measured 2026-09-04: 80 inbound payments worth
-- 12,502.79 USDC were invisible to the gas-station filter -- more than the 10,858.99 it did
-- report. Stellar was undercounted by more than half.
--
-- So coverage is the union: we sponsored it, OR either side is a Sendzz address. The roster
-- supplies the second half, exactly as it does on EVM.
--
-- Verified 2026-09-04: 300 payments, 23,361.78 USDC.
--   outbound (sponsored, from ours)  219   10,816.99
--   inbound  (to ours)                80   12,502.79
--   internal (both ours)               1        42.00

